      "solution": "days = int(input())\nstem = list(input())\nlength = len(stem)\n\n# Day by day simulation\nfor _ in range(days):\n    new_stem = stem.copy()\n    \n    for i in range(length):\n        if stem[i] == '#':\n            if i > 0:\n                new_stem[i - 1] = '#'\n            if i < length - 1:\n                new_stem[i + 1] = '#'\n                \n    stem = new_stem\n\nprint(\"\".join(stem))",
